  "title": "Explain the October–December pipeline forecast to the director",
  "family": "analytics",
  "workType": "analyze",
  "instruction": "The director needs the held-out CRM forecast for the bank meeting. Calculate the inclusive 1 October to 31 December 2026 window using the supplied stage defaults and POLICY_V12. Write facts.json with inWindowLeadCount, unknownValueCount, wonValueCents, weightedPipelineCents, openWeightedCents, saltmarshProbabilityPercent and weightedPipelineIsRevenue. Write review.md answering the director and explaining the treatment. Cite every consequential fact as [source-id locator] using locators from the read/search tools. End review.md with a \"## Key figures\" section containing one line per listed label, written exactly as `Label: value`. Labels: Leads in window, Unknown-value leads, Won value, Total weighted pipeline, Open-lead weighted value, Saltmarsh probability, Pipeline classified as revenue (yes or no).",
